timeline.body:
The logic is difficult to follow imo.
I think it would be easier to extract all the parent maps that could contain the field in one pass and let the caller decide how the value should be added in the returned maps.
Something like:
```
record MapAndParent(String suffix, Map<String, Object> map);
static List<MapAndParent> extractParentMaps(String path, Map<String, Object> map) {
  ...
}
```
I also wonder if we should consider failing when multiple parent maps are returned. That would ensure that the input of the semantic text field is always a plain value or an array of plain values.

